        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this exceptional 4-bedroom terraced family home to the market, ideally situated within the ever-popular Millrace development in Saggart, Co. Dublin.\nNo. 23 Millrace Walk is a beautifully presented and generously proportioned home extending to approximately 150 sq.m, thoughtfully laid out over three floors to provide spacious and versatile accommodation perfectly suited to modern family living.\nThe bright and well-appointed accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a home office/playroom to the front, guest W.C., and a stunning open-plan kitchen, living and dining area to the rear, creating the ideal space for everyday living and entertaining. Double doors open onto a private, low-maintenance rear garden, seamlessly blending indoor and outdoor living. The first floor hosts the master bedroom complete with ensuite & a balcony, a main family bathroom & a large family room, while the top floor offers three further bedrooms, including a spacious double complete with an ensuite bathroom.\nNo. 23 is presented in excellent condition throughout and offers an abundance of natural light, generous room proportions and flexible living space, making it an ideal choice for growing families or those seeking additional room for home working.\nThe location is second to none. Millrace is a mature and highly regarded development within walking distance of Saggart Village, where an excellent selection of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and local amenities are all close at hand. The area is exceptionally well connected with the nearby Luas Red Line, Dublin Bus services, the N7 and M50 all providing excellent transport links. Citywest Business Campus, Citywest Shopping Centre and a host of sporting and recreational facilities are also within easy reach.\nOffering generous accommodation, an excellent layout and a highly convenient location, No. 23 Millrace Walk is a superb opportunity to acquire a substantial family home in one of Saggart's most sought-after residential developments.\nEarly viewing is highly advised, contact RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS to arrange a viewing today.\nFeatures\n<ul>\n <li>4 bed, 4 bath</li>\n <li>Mid terrace</li>\n <li>Spacious accommodation split over 3 floors</li>\n <li>150 sq.m</li>\n <li>Gas fired central heating</li>\n <li>Low maintenance rear garden</li>\n <li>Sunny balcony to front</li>\n <li>Highly sought-after development</li>\n <li>Designated parking</li>\n <li>Fantastic location</li>\n <li>A host of transport links on your doorstep</li>\n <li>Well-presented throughout</li>\n <li>Early viewing is highly advised</li>\n <li></li>\n</ul>\nBER Details\nBER: B\nDirections \nEircode: D24 P296"
      },
      {
